# Hardware channel position of: left tweeter, right tweeter, left woofer, right woofer
# on the "speakers" node (4 channels FL,FR,RL,RR = hw channels 0..3).
# Checked 2026-10-16 by ear and with the internal mic (150-300 Hz noise only
# from the woofers): hw 0 = left woofer, 1 = right tweeter, 2 = left tweeter,
# 3 = right woofer. Same as the TDM slots of the SSM3515s in the driver
# (0x14->0, 0x16->1, 0x15->2, 0x17->3) with Apple's names for the amps.
RL,FR,FL,RR
